  "summary_text": "Corvid Bank\nCorvid: verbal yes, 150 seats at $25\nCorvid wants the latest pen test report\nOnboarding calls and security questionnaire and notes from last time\nOnboarding calls is not urgent\nOnboarding calls is the scary part\nSecurity questionnaire is fine for now\nNotes from last time is sort of on hold\nNotes from last time is more of a people problem\nPreference to do it properly rather than look at it with fresh eyes\nHandoff and ownership question and requirements\nHandoff is not a big deal\nOwnership question is mostly fine\nOwnership question is a little fragile\nRequirements is a nice to have\nScope and doc and edge cases\nScope is basically done\nDoc: there's more going on than i thought\nEdge cases is taking longer than expected\nFeedback and change management piece and support tickets\nReal issue may be requirements rather than feedback\nOpen question: what the plan is for change management piece\nSupport tickets is sort of on hold",
