      "text": "The way I see it, I don't know know if the security questionnaire is really the issue.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:09:25.427000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:09:31.094000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I think if the the pilot group group slips again, Corvid Bank is going to feel it. On Corvid Bank, it like looked pretty reasonable, more or less. Okay, so it's funny, the bulk import looked still pretty rough like on Friday and now it's mostly noise.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:09:31.126000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:09:46.793000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Jordan Blake"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, agreed.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:09:39.155000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:09:39.755000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, fair.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:09:48.081000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:09:48.748000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Jordan Blake"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, I don't know if the legal review is really the issue, honestly.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:09:48.813000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:09:53.480000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Jordan Blake"
      },
      "text": "Okay, I keep coming back the usage reports, more or less.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:09:53.484000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:09:57.151000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Jordan Blake"
      },
      "text": "Funny enough",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:09:57.354000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:09:58.021000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Jordan Blake"
      },
      "text": "honestly the communication plan only needs three or four like tries if we run it by support.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:00.039000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:05.705000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Jordan Blake"
      },
      "text": "But you know",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:09.851000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:10.851000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Jordan Blake"
      },
      "text": "what's the plan for the regional teams?",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:11.865000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:14.199000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Mira Shah"
      },
      "text": "Okay",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:14.207000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:14.807000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Corvid Bank is kind of the test like case for the training sessions.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:14.857000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:19.191000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Mira Shah"
      },
      "text": "But the annoying thing about",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:19.223000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:20.889000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Mira Shah"
      },
      "text": "the rollout plan is it's the obvious next thing...",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:21.163000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:24.163000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Mira Shah"
      },
      "text": "Um...",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:24.695000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:25.295000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Mira Shah"
      },
      "text": "Like, my worry with the regional teams is the dependencies on other teams.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:25.375000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:29.709000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "It's like, the original proposal is way more complicated than like it looks and nobody wants too say it.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:29.727000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:36.060000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "And then we've been saying we'd run it by support like for a while, if that makes sense.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:36.473000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:42.473000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Mira Shah"
      },
      "text": "Okay, that works.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:39.559000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:40.159000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Well, there's a world where we run it by support and the invoicing setup just goes away...",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:43.209000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:48.875000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Love that.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:48.950000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:49.617000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Okay, so I talked to people on the other team about the original proposal and they had a lot of opinions.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:49.657000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:56.657000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Which",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:59.138000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:59.738000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "the onboarding calls is the scary part.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:10:59.750000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:02.083000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Oh, really?",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:01.469000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:02.069000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "So I spent a couple of hours",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:02.091000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:04.424000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "on the email digests and it seems to",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:05.006000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:07.673000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "come and go.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:07.705000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:08.705000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Mira Shah"
      },
      "text": "We need your latest penetration test report.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:08.715000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:11.049000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Sounds good.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:11.100000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:11.767000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Sorry, my headphones died.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:12.285000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:13.618000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "Honestly, it's less about the feedback and more about the requirements, right.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:13.647000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:17.647000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Wait, what's the plan for the change management piece?",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:17.738000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:20.738000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Jordan Blake"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, so honestly the scope only needs a dozen tickets if we do a proper write-up.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:20.830000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:26.163000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "Right, so when I I mean, looked at the success plan for Corvid Bank, nobody's really touched it in a while.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:26.233000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:33.233000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:37.700000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:38.300000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "Oh, really?",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:38.370000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:39.037000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "Oh, for Corvid Bank specifically, the support tickets is sort of on hold, at least for now",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:39.077000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:44.744000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "Like,",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:45.652000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:46.252000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "the annoying like thing about the executive sponsor is it's fine in theory",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:47.005000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:51.339000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I feel like honestly the process only needs most of the afternoon if we just ship the smaller version. For what it's worth, I talked to a few managers about the original proposal and they didn't love it.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:11:51.380000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:12:04.047000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Okay.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:12:04.700000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:12:05.300000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Actually,",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:12:05.362000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:12:05.962000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "honestly the tradeoffs like only needs like 15 calls if we park it for now.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:12:05.993000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:12:10.993000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "But should we just pair on I mean, it?",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:12:22.502000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:12:25.502000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Jordan Blake"
      },
      "text": "Love that.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:12:24.243000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:12:24.843000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "To be like fair, it's funny, the priority list looked the scary part like before this call and now I got kind of lost.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:12:25.590000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:12:33.590000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "Out of curiosity, can we check with legal?",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:12:34.478000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:12:37.145000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "So I spent twenty minutes on the dependencies and it happened two or three times.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:12:47.489000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:12:52.489000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Felix Moreau"
      },
      "text": "So I'd love to split it into two pieces, but the permissions model is unclear.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:12:52.814000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:12:57.814000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Mira Shah"
      },
      "text": "Okay, that works...",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:12:59.235000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:13:00.235000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Fair.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:13:00.277000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:13:00.877000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Basically the next steps took like like most of the afternoon last time, if that helps.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:13:00.888000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:13:06.221000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "I feel like the follow ups is a bit messy, I think. Yeah, yeah, the annoying thing about the renewal conversation is it's a bit messy. So does the audit trail actually matter for Corvid Bank? And like I'm not super excited about the integration with their HR system and stuff. Anyway, the short version is the legal review is basically done, I think. And a few managers keep asking about the data residency question, right. Yeah, so I think the risk is that it just sits there.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:13:06.297000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:13:35.630000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Jordan Blake"
      },
      "text": "Cool, I'll let you all go. Thanks...",
      "start_time": "2026-10-20T16:13:35.721000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-20T16:13:38.054000Z"
    }
  ]
